   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n  \r\n\r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\">\r\n    <font face=\"Arial\" size=\"-1\">Pozdravljeni!</font><font face=\"Arial\"><br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <font size=\"-1\">Formulirala sem sledeči model:</font><br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <font size=\"-1\">M3.9&lt;-glmmPQL(Lin_f1,</font><br>\r\n      <font size=\"-1\">              random = ~1|ime,</font><br>\r\n      <font size=\"-1\">              weights = varIdent(~1|ime),</font><br>\r\n      <font size=\"-1\">              family = binomial,</font><br>\r\n      <font size=\"-1\">              data = sub2.1)</font><br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <font size=\"-1\">Lin_f1 &lt;- cnt01 ~ ark + road + ... + urbano_d +\r\n        gnezdo_d</font><br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <font size=\"-1\">R mi javlja sledečo napako:</font><br>\r\n      <font size=\"-1\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in\r\n          model.frame.default(data = sub2.1, weights = varIdent(~1 |\r\n          ime), : variable lengths differ (found for &#39;(weights)&#39;)</span><br>\r\n        <br>\r\n      </font></font><font face=\"Arial\"><font size=\"-1\"><font face=\"Arial\"><font size=\"-1\">- Model lahko zaženem brez težav,\r\n            če izločim argument &#39;weights&#39;.<br>\r\n          </font></font>- &#39;ime&#39; je faktorska spremenljivka s tremi\r\n        ravnmi, ki ne vsebuje NA vrednosti.<br>\r\n        - Vse spremenljivke, uporabljene v modelu, so vsebovane v\r\n        dataframe-u &#39;sub2.1&#39;.<br>\r\n        - Dataset &#39;sub2.1&#39; ne vsebuje nobene NA vrednosti. <br>\r\n        - V workspace-u nimam drugih objektov z imenom &#39;ime&#39;.<br>\r\n        - Nimam &#39;pripetega&#39; nobenega dataframe-a s funkcijo attach().<br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        Ima kdo morda idejo, kje bi lahko bil izvor težav?<br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        Hvala za pomoč!<br>\r\n        <br>\r\n        Urša<br>\r\n      </font><br>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <br>\r\n    </font><br>\r\n  \r\n<br><br>\r\n<hr style=\"border:none;color:#909090;background-color:#b0b0b0;min-height:1px;width:99%\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border:none\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td style=\"border:none;padding:0px 15px 0px 8px\">\r\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.avast.com/antivirus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.avast.com/antivirus&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237101398000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1XKG_jNGh6UWCkdXfXGP66\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<img border=\"0\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/0Q_vVrbZDtbojQ67yV7xHbpChV0AMQW5PxOF-r8Lnj3VUO7tQeKEoBFYkKeCkgWivYRKezsvSGEvAHd7et2gtKjoJ2kfEg=s0-d-e1-ft#http://static.avast.com/emails/avast-mail-stamp.png\" alt=\"Avast logo\">\r\n\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"color:#3d4d5a;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;Helvetica&quot;;font-size:12pt\">\r\n\t\t\t\tTa e-pošta je bila pregledana z Avast protivirusnim programom.\r\n\t\t\t\t<br><a href=\"https://www.avast.com/antivirus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.avast.com/antivirus&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237101398000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1XKG_jNGh6UWCkdXfXGP66\">www.avast.com</a>\r\n\t\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t</td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
