     "<div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\"><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif\"><a href=\"http://stats.stackexchange.com/a/164315/144\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stats.stackexchange.com/a/164315/144&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237101405000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3W8cIo33XsPW00o9UoADdm\">Alain pravi</a>, da so `varIdent` uporabili\r\n          samo za modele z normalno porazdelitvijo.</div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif\"><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif\">lp,</div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif\">Roman</div>\r\n        <div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br>\r\n          <div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Dec 20, 2016 at 11:56 AM,\r\n            Ursa Koce GMAIL <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ursa...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span>\r\n            wrote:<br>\r\n            <blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n              <div bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" text=\"#000000\"> <font face=\"Arial\" size=\"-1\">Pozdravljeni!</font><font face=\"Arial\"><br>\r\n                  <br>\r\n                  <font size=\"-1\">Formulirala sem sledeči model:</font><br>\r\n                  <br>\r\n                  <font size=\"-1\">M3.9&lt;-glmmPQL(Lin_f1,</font><br>\r\n                  <font size=\"-1\">              random = ~1|ime,</font><br>\r\n                  <font size=\"-1\">              weights =\r\n                    varIdent(~1|ime),</font><br>\r\n                  <font size=\"-1\">              family = binomial,</font><br>\r\n                  <font size=\"-1\">              data = sub2.1)</font><br>\r\n                  <br>\r\n                  <font size=\"-1\">Lin_f1 &lt;- cnt01 ~ ark + road + ...\r\n                    + urbano_d + gnezdo_d</font><br>\r\n                  <br>\r\n                  <font size=\"-1\">R mi javlja sledečo napako:</font><br>\r\n                  <font size=\"-1\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in\r\n                      model.frame.default(data = sub2.1, weights =\r\n                      varIdent(~1 | ime), : variable lengths differ\r\n                      (found for &#39;(weights)&#39;)</span><br>\r\n                    <br>\r\n                  </font></font><font face=\"Arial\"><font size=\"-1\"><font face=\"Arial\"><font size=\"-1\">- Model lahko zaženem\r\n                        brez težav, če izločim argument &#39;weights&#39;.<br>\r\n                      </font></font>- &#39;ime&#39; je faktorska spremenljivka s\r\n                    tremi ravnmi, ki ne vsebuje NA vrednosti.<br>\r\n                    - Vse spremenljivke, uporabljene v modelu, so\r\n                    vsebovane v dataframe-u &#39;sub2.1&#39;.<br>\r\n                    - Dataset &#39;sub2.1&#39; ne vsebuje nobene NA vrednosti. <br>\r\n                    - V workspace-u nimam drugih objektov z imenom\r\n                    &#39;ime&#39;.<br>\r\n                    - Nimam &#39;pripetega&#39; nobenega dataframe-a s funkcijo\r\n                    attach().<br>\r\n                    <br>\r\n                    Ima kdo morda idejo, kje bi lahko bil izvor težav?<br>\r\n                    <br>\r\n                    Hvala za pomoč!<br>\r\n                    <br>\r\n                    Urša<br>\r\n                  </font><br>\r\n                  <br>\r\n                  <br>\r\n                </font><br>\r\n                <br>\r\n                <br>\r\n                <hr style=\"border:none;color:#909090;background-color:#b0b0b0;min-height:1px;width:99%\"><span><font color=\"#888888\"> </font></span><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n                  </font